Z||000010||grinthock||08-17-2001||03:59 PM||||Hey aus, seems stable, If you check your firewall (assuming that it even saw me) I port scanned the whole thing, no holes, the system looks stable, I used 20-30 other machines in various locations to ping attack the server, and it didn't caff.<P>Hope this was the test you wanted, seems stable, now if we get EVERY Fiero.NL member to ping it at a specific time THAT would be a test.<P><BR>Also, I am not sure about the opening of ANOTHER forum, does it not kind of split up the group a bit?   I know some of you are also thinking this too, another forum?  I dunno...... <P>Comments?||||reg||1
